            notes: "Above the trees: the krummholz of the tree line, then meadows of grass, sedge and flowers, cushions and lichens on the screes, and bare rock and ice. Summer is short and cold, and the grazers come up to it and go down again; the burrowers sleep the winter out or live under the snow on their stores.",
