            notes: "The rivers, lakes, marshes and bogs of the temperate and northern lands: reed beds and lily ponds, willow and alder carrs, the bogs' sphagnum. Fish densities are per km² of water, the rest per km² of the land about it; the land's animals come to drink.",
        ),
