            notes: "Hot and wet the year round: a closed canopy thirty to fifty metres up with emergent giants above it, lianas, epiphytes and a dim floor of shade-bearing herbs. Most of its animals live in the canopy and on fruit; on the floor, large animals are few and thinly spread. A fallen giant opens a gap that bananas, gingers and pioneer trees race to fill.",
        ),
